{"id":"orgullo","lemma":"orgullo","pos":"noun","rank":1636,"glosses":["pride (arrogance, haughtiness)","pride (sense of self-worth)","pride (something of which one is proud)"],"ipa":"/oɾˈɡuʝo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"orgullos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1f/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-orgullo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eres mi orgullo y alegría.","en":"You are my pride and joy.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"joy, happiness"}]},{"text":"Él se tragó su orgullo.","en":"He swallowed his pride.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to swallow","l":"tragar"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Tiene mucho orgullo en su apariencia.","en":"He has too much pride in his appearance.","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"appearance"}]},{"text":"Mis hijos me llenan de orgullo.","en":"My children make me proud.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"son","l":"hijo"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to fill something up","l":"llenar"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"La derrota hirió su orgullo.","en":"Losing injured their pride.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639868","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"path, route, track"},{"g":"to wound, injure","l":"herir"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}